NOTE ON SCOPE

This license covers the code in this repository: the interactive tool pages,
the shared runtime under tools/, the build and test harness, and the figure
and social-card generators.

It does NOT grant rights to:

  * the site's prose -- biography, research descriptions, publication and
    talk listings;
  * the paper explainer videos under assets/*.mp4 and their posters;
  * the manim sources that render them.

Those remain All Rights Reserved. The interactive physics widgets are the part
meant to be reused, and they are the part this license is for.

