THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

Some photographs of the site owner were taken by other people. Their copyright
is held by the photographer or by the commissioning institution, not by the
site owner, so they fall outside BOTH the MIT grant above and the All Rights
Reserved reservation immediately above it. Nothing in this file grants any
right to them, and the reservation above does not assert one.

Each such photograph carries its credit line next to it on the site, naming the
photographer or the institution that holds the copyright. That credit line is
the authoritative record of who holds what. Anyone wanting to reuse one of
these images should approach the holder named there; this license cannot and
does not speak for them.
